.Dd July 13, 2026
.Dt YT-TRANSCRIBE 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm yt-transcribe
.Nd high-accuracy YouTube / audio transcription pipeline
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar url
.Op Ar options
.Nm
.Fl -from-wav Ar wav
.Fl -output-base Ar base
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
(invoked as
.Ic ztranscribe )
downloads the best audio and metadata for a YouTube
.Ar url ,
converts it to 16 kHz mono, and transcribes it with whisper.cpp into several
formats under
.Pa ~/Downloads/transcripts/<video_id>/ .
The Z-169
.Fl -from-wav
mode skips the download and transcribes a window of an already-prepared 16 kHz
wav instead.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -keep-media
Keep the original downloaded
.Pa .wav
(removed by default).
.It Fl -diarize
Identify speakers (requires
.Ev HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN ) .
.It Fl -summarize
Generate an AI summary and cleanup (requires the local llama-server).
.It Fl -json-full
Emit token-level confidence
.Pq Fl -output-json-full
instead of segment-only JSON.
.It Fl -out-dir Ar dir
Override the retention directory (default
.Pa ~/Downloads/transcripts ) .
.It Fl -prompt Ar text
Bias whisper toward known vocabulary.
Also disables prior-text conditioning suppression for that run.
.It Fl -profile Ar p
Whisper profile:
.Ar max-accuracy
(default),
.Ar standard ,
or
.Ar light .
.It Fl -prep-only
Download and convert to a 16 kHz wav, report its path and duration, and stop
before whisper (feeds windowed chunk jobs).
.It Fl -from-wav Ar wav
Transcribe a window of an existing 16 kHz wav; skips download and conversion.
Requires
.Fl -output-base .
.It Fl -offset-sec Ar n
Window start, in seconds, for
.Fl -from-wav .
.It Fl -window-sec Ar n
Window length, in seconds, for
.Fl -from-wav .
.It Fl -output-base Ar base
Whisper output-file base; required with
.Fl -from-wav .
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root; locates
.Xr whisper-ctl 1 ,
.Xr diarize 1 ,
and
.Xr ai-query 1 .
.It Ev HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN
Required for
.Fl -diarize .
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_PROFILE , Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_MODELS_DIR
Override the active whisper profile and model directory.
.El
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
Any unrecognized
.Fl -flag
is rejected: the pipeline prints
.Ql yt-transcribe: error: unknown flag: <flag> ,
emits usage, and exits
.Va 1 .
This prevents a mistyped option (for example
.Fl -offset
in place of
.Fl -offset-sec )
from being silently swallowed as the positional
.Ar url
and running with the flag ignored.
A bare, non-flag argument is still accepted as the
.Ar url .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ai-query 1 ,
.Xr diarize 1 ,
.Xr whisper-ctl 1
